Vim plugin providing the
.B :Diffvim
command for running inside an existing vim session.
.TP
.I autoload/diffvim/engine.vim
Standalone vimscript engine (sourced by the plugin).
.TP
.I completion/diffvim.bash
Bash shell completion script.
.TP
.I completion/_diffvim
Zsh shell completion script.
.TP
.I completion/diffvim.fish
Fish shell completion script.
.TP
.I packaging/diffvim.rb
Homebrew formula for macOS installation.

